{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/opaque"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Entry points into ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"libaxiam_opaque_ffi"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §23).","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque\/available()","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque\/startLogin(password:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque\/startRegistration(password:)"],"title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Opaque"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no cryptography in this enum, or anywhere in this package. That is deliberate and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what §23.1 requires: OPAQUE needs an oblivious PRF, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hash_to_curve"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expand_message_xmd"},{"type":"text","text":", an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"envelope construction and a three-message AKE, and eleven independent implementations of that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is eleven chances to be subtly and silently wrong. The SRP-6a this replaces was arithmetic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every language can express — which here meant a hand-written big-integer modular exponentiation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pbkdf2_sha256"},{"type":"text","text":"-only limitation on top, because Swift has no Argon2 that ships on every"},{"type":"text","text"